From: Nex package maintainers
Subject: insert the transient tier between the administrator and vendor a11y bus config
Source: Nex downstream patch for at-spi2-core 2.54.0
Upstream: not submitted; needs agreement on the transient path

ensure_a11y_bus() selects one complete D-Bus policy file for the
accessibility bus: the administrator's SYSCONFDIR/at-spi2/accessibility.conf
when it exists, otherwise the packaged DATADIR/defaults/at-spi2/accessibility.conf.
Insert /run/at-spi2/accessibility.conf between those two tiers so a
transient deployment can ship its own complete policy file without
writing into /etc. The check stays a plain existence test, so an empty
higher-tier file still wins and masks the tiers below it. The
administrator path, the vendor path, and the no-administrator/no-runtime
vendor fallback are unchanged; ATSPI_DBUS_IMPLEMENTATION selection is
untouched.

--- a/bus/at-spi-bus-launcher.c
+++ b/bus/at-spi-bus-launcher.c
@@ -538,0 +539,2 @@
+  else if (g_file_test ("/run/at-spi2/accessibility.conf", G_FILE_TEST_EXISTS))
+    config_path = "--config-file=/run/at-spi2/accessibility.conf";
